Z||000000||2M4 Dale||12-12-2001||12:36 PM||||We at CFOG-I are trying to make this the best club we can be. We do not intend to cater only to the show and shine crowd but also to the racers !!!<P>Is there any interest form any one out there in being a sports writer for our club magazine !!!<P>Requirements for this position would be as follows.<BR>1. Membership in CFOG-I<BR>2. Time to handle duties as Sports editor<BR>3. Will to handle duties as Sports editor<BR>4. Want to handle duties as Sports editor<P><BR>We will be publishing a quarterly magazine  and need someone well versed and knowlegable about Fieros and the Racing scene.<P>I suppose that this should and would include the AutoX scene as well as other road racing venues such as SCCA club racing....Dragracing.....Street (things like HotRod Power Tour...etc)<P>email me at dalelee22@cs.com and check out the CFOG-I website !!! <A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cfog-i.org/</A> ||||reg||4
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||12-13-2001||12:49 AM||||What ??? no takers ??? I figured that one of you outspoken race fans would love the idea of getting published in a international newsletter........talking about what you love the most Hi-Performance Fieros and thier exploits at the track or on the street !!!<P>I'm trying to show incentive here ... If I have to be sports editor as well as Central Region Director then I know I'm gonna suck !!! LMAO<P>I love auto racing in all its forms but I'm not a racer myself......I would be like a baseball player writing a football byline !!!||||reg||12
